            This is one song off Sammy's new album "I Want My Money Back."
I felt obliged to put it up here because, (a) nobody else has
done it, and (b) I'm good friends with Jason Campbell, who wrote
this song and that pretty much ushered him into Nashville. Enjoy!

As an added note, Sammy uses some kind of doppler style effect
plus a repeat echo style effect on the studio cut, so the parts
of the song where the effect is used will be labeled as (echoed)
for your convenience.

